==English==
===Etymology===
Old English ''[[hæþen]]''

===Pronunciation===
*:Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-iːðən|-iːðən]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun2|'''heathen'''|'''heathen '''or''' [[heathens]]'''}}

#A person who does not [[believe]] in anything [[supernatural]], especially any incorporeal, sentient, intentional, puissance that might intervene in natural phenomena and therefore require [[propitiation]] such as a [[god]]. Not the same as an [[Atheist]], [[Agnostic]], [[Pagan]], or adherent of any other [[arcane]] belief system or cosmology.

